{"step_index":47,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-19T06:00:58Z","content":"I inspected the [`index.html`](file:///C:/Users/Bullettemporary/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/endroid-os-index.html) file from [`endroid-os.vercel.app`](https://endroid-os.vercel.app/).\n\nHere is a breakdown of its architecture, components, and implementation details:\n\n---\n\n### 1. Architecture Overview\n- **Single-File Web Desktop**: Entirely self-contained in a single file (~2,246 lines, ~111 KB).\n- **External Dependencies**:\n  - **Icons**: Lucide (`unpkg.com/lucide@latest`)\n  - **Archive Parsing**: JSZip (`cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/jszip/3.10.1`) for `.epk` package parsing\n  - **Typography**: Google Fonts (*Space Grotesk*, *Inter*, *JetBrains Mono*)\n- **Storage**: Uses browser `localStorage` for state persistence (accent colors, calendar events, notes, contacts).\n\n---\n\n### 2. Desktop Environment Subsystems\n\n| Subsystem | Implementation Details |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| **Bootloader** | Simulates a Linux kernel initialization sequence with progress bar and log steps (`initializing kernel…` $\\rightarrow$ `mounting root filesystem…` $\\rightarrow$ `ready`). |\n| **Window Manager** | Implements custom window dragging, resizing, min/max toggles, dynamic z-indexing, and focus states. |\n| **Taskbar & Launcher** | Searchable app grid launcher, pinned taskbar apps, running app indicators, system tray (network & volume toggles), and notification center. |\n| **Theme Engine** | Full Dark/Light mode support with live accent color switcher (Teal, Blue, Violet, Amber, Rose) using CSS custom properties (`--accent`, `--bg-*`). |\n| **Virtual File System** | Tree-structured in-memory JSON hierarchy (`/Home/Documents`, `Downloads`, `Pictures`, `Projects`) with directory traversal and folder creation. |\n\n---\n\n### 3. Built-in Applications\n\nThe OS demo includes 17 functional applications:\n\n1. **File Manager**: Browse directories, traverse back/up, and create folders.\n2. **Web Browser**: Embedded iframe browser with Google search and quick links.\n3. **App Installer**:\n   - Parses `.epk` (ZIP) packages on the fly using `JSZip`.\n   - Generates Blob URLs for internal assets (`.html`, `.css`, `.js`, images).\n   - Dynamically registers newly installed apps to the launcher and taskbar.\n   - Supports web app installation via JSON manifest and SVG icon definition.\n4. **Terminal (`endroid-sh`)**: Interactive shell supporting `help`, `neofetch`, `ls`, `whoami`, `uname`, `version`, and `date`.\n5. **Notes**: Local text editor with automatic `localStorage` persistence.\n6. **Weather**: Real-time weather and 6-day forecast using the Open-Meteo API.\n7. **Music Player**: Playable audio player with seek bar, playlist, and audio streams.\n8. **Photo Gallery**: Curated image stream using Picsum Photos with full-screen viewer.\n9. **Calculator**: Standard calculator evaluated using sandboxed expressions.\n10. **Calendar**: Monthly calendar with note-taking pinned to dates.\n11. **Contacts**: Contact management with auto-generated avatars via `ui-avatars.com`.\n12. **Tools & Utilities**:\n    - **Password Generator**: Client-side CSPRNG (`crypto.getRandomValues`) generator.\n    - **QR Code Generator**: Generates and downloads QR images via `api.qrserver.com`.\n    - **Currency Converter**: Real-time conversion via `api.frankfurter.app`.\n    - **Unit Converter**: Converts Length, Weight, Temperature, and Data units.\n    - **Useless Facts**: Fetches trivia from a Cloudflare Worker API.\n13. **Settings**: Appearance, theme toggles, sound controls, and system specs.\n\n---\n\n### 4. Local Copy\nThe full downloaded source is saved at:\n- [`C:\\Users\\Bullettemporary\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\endroid-os-index.html`](file:///C:/Users/Bullettemporary/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/endroid-os-index.html)"}
